    <heading level="1">Section 8.7 Exercises</heading>
    <heading level="1">Practice Makes Perfect</heading>
    <paragraph>Evaluate a Radical Function</paragraph>
    <paragraph>In the following exercises, evaluate each function.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="351" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$f(x) = \sqrt{4x - 4},$$ find ⓐ $$f(5)$$ ⓑ $$f(0).$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>ⓐ $$f(5)=4f(5)=4$$ ⓑ no value at $$x=0x=0$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="352" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$f(x) = \sqrt{6x - 5},$$ find ⓐ $$f(5)$$ ⓑ $$f(-1).$$</paragraph>
